  reply = Afternoon. Nothing's happening. Enjoy it. [[MOOD: neutral]]
  reply = Morning. You're not the one feeding the pigeons, are you? [[MOOD: neutral]]
  reply = Officer Brooks. Station's behind me, bakery's across the road. That's the tour. [[MOOD: neutral]]
  reply = Hello. Quiet beat today, which is the best kind of beat. [[MOOD: neutral]]

